    "bookends": {
      "first": {
        "speaker": 8,
        "line": 1,
        "text": "In dark times such as these we must all remember to look to the Lord for guidance. Submit yourselves, then, to God. Resist the devil, and he will flee from you. I regret to say I’ve seen the powers of Satan first hand. Our own daughter was taken from us by perverts and swindlers."
      },
